    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "sparks? i don't see any sparks. i just feel like i'm haunting a life that doesn't belong to me anymore. it's like i'm just waiting for something to happen, or like i'm just stuck in this loop of existing without any reason why. everything is just so quiet and heavy. it feels like as much as i try to \"find myself,\" there's nothing left to find. it's just... nothingness.",
